  "body": "In reference to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#meta-referrer\n\nRather than defining candidate elements to include meta elements that are \"a child of a head element,\" \nit seems to make more sense to just consider those that are the child of \"the head element of the document\" (as already defined https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#the-head-element-2).\n",
